WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.189 --> 00:00:31.809
Question 1 - Samuel Asks, who do you think
is behind GUS, Missy seems too passive to

00:00:31.809 --> 00:00:44.350
do something 

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:59.460
like that?

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:03.319
Question 2 - Matt asks, when the Doctor was
talking to himself I thought it sounded a

00:01:03.319 --> 00:01:04.640
bit like Tom Baker.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:28.670
Was he 
doing an homage?

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:33.040
Question 3 - Mahleks asks was there more to
the engineer character than we saw.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:02:00.950
He seemed to have a suspicious amount 
of knowledge, was he connected to GUS?

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:04.750
Question 4 - Glenn asks, I haven’t watched
any of the other doctor’s before.

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:08.729
Is Capaldi anything like the other doctors?

00:02:08.729 --> 00:02:27.490
Question 5 - Gaming Funky asks, do you think
there’s any part of The Doctor that loves

00:02:27.490 --> 00:03:07.760
Clara?

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:12.319
Question 6 - Hanah asks, when Clara said I
love you to Danny on the phone do you think

00:03:12.319 --> 00:03:14.200
she was also talking about The Doctor?

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:21.910
Question 7 - Cyber asks, do you think the
mummy person is someone we know?

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:55.480
Question 8 - Dino asks, what was 
the planet the Doctor 

00:03:55.480 --> 00:04:20.000
dropped 

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:32.790
everyone 
off at.

00:04:32.790 --> 00:05:00.520
Question 9 - Suddenly Joy asks, when the Doctor
says things like “oh that was ages ago”,

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:30.360
is he going off and doing other things without
everyone.

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:35.790
Question 10 - DWFA asks, do you think Danny
will remember the Doctor from his childhood

00:05:35.790 --> 00:06:56.820
and who do you think he killed during 

00:06:56.820 --> 00:07:09.889
the war 

00:07:09.889 --> 00:07:26.439
that he can’t talk about?

